{"sections":[{"slug":"Whitehead塔","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Whitehead塔"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Whitehead <span lang=\"zh\">塔</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Whitehead 塔"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">带基点</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $*\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Whitehead <span lang=\"zh\">塔是对映射</span> $*\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">作</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/连通-截断分解","text":"($n$-<span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>, $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">分解</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">所得的序列</span>\n$$\r\n*\\to \\cdots \\to Z_2 \\to Z_1 \\to Z_0 \\to Z_{-1} \\to Z_{-2} =X,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">满足</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$*\\to Z_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">映射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span> $Z_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $(n+1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>;</li>\n<li>$Z_n\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">映射</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">纤维</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记号如上</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">映射</span> $Z_n\\to Z_{n-1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的纤维为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Eilenberg–MacLane空间","text":"Eilenberg–MacLane <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $K(\\pi_{n+1}(X),n)$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">一种显式构造</span></h3>\n<p>$Z_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一种显式构造为</span> $\\mathbf{B}^{n+2}\\Omega^{n+2}X$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与截断的关系</span></h3>\n<p>$Z_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">是如下的拉回</span>.\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n\t{ccc}\r\n\tZ_n &amp; \\to &amp; *\\\\\r\n\t\\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\downarrow\\\\\r\n\tX &amp; \\to &amp; \\tau_{\\leq n+1} X.\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p>$n=-1$:</p>\n<p>$Z_{-1}\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是基点处的连通分支</span>.</p>\n<p>$n=0$:</p>\n<p>$Z_0 \\to Z_{-1}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/万有覆叠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">万有覆叠</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">正交群</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">正交群</span> $\\mathrm{O}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Whitehead <span lang=\"zh\">塔为</span>\n$$\r\n\\cdots\\to \\text{String}_n \\to \\mathrm{Spin}_n \\to \\mathrm{SO}_n \\to \\mathrm{O}_n.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Postnikov塔","text":"Postnikov <span lang=\"zh\">塔</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}